  => star <-> 4K1 (independent 4-sets), fork <-> P3+K1, path <-> P4; the 4-subset is a spanning tree of K_5
     iff its induced Petersen graph is one of 4K1, P3+K1, P4 (and not K2+2K1, 2K2, K_{1,3}).
  alpha(Petersen) = 4; the 5 maximum independent sets are the 5 stars of K_5 (Erdos--Ko--Rado for (5,2)).

