C. Containment of the three trees in K_5, K_{3,3}, Petersen; Erdos--Sos star-extremality
==============================================================================
  K_5      n= 5 e=10 3n/2=  7.5  contains path:True fork:True star:True  maxdeg=4
  K_{3,3}  n= 6 e= 9 3n/2=  9.0  contains path:True fork:True star:False  maxdeg=3
  Petersen n=10 e=15 3n/2= 15.0  contains path:True fork:True star:False  maxdeg=3
  K_{3,3} (n=6) and Petersen (n=10) are cubic, hence K_{1,4}-free with exactly 3n/2 = ex(n, K_{1,4}) edges:
  both are Erdos--Sos star-extremal witnesses at t = 5; neither is path/fork-extremal (those need disjoint K_4's).

